  "description": "RURVEG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C190 H195 Eu5 O45,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.608-5.231 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.76-160.58°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C190H195Eu5O45·4C7H8. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
